    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n36878" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξαπορέω</span></b> , strengthd. for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπορέω,</span> to be in <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>great doubt</i> or <i>difficulty,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				4.34.1
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῖς πράγμασι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Ath.</u>
					23.1
				</span></i>
			:—
				Med.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπορούμενοι, ἀλλ᾽ οὐκ ἐ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>2 Ep.Cor.</u>
					4.8
				</span></i>
			: so in aor.
			
				Pass.
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξηπορήθην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>Ps.</u>
					87(88).15
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				24.1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Alc.</u>
				5
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξαπορηθῆναι ἀργυρίον</span>
			<i>to be without</i> money, <i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				7.18
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν κοινῶν ἐξηπορημένων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>SIG</u>
					495.12
				</span></i>
			 (Olbia, <span class="entity">iii B. C.</span>), cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>PEleph.</u>
				2.10
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B. C.)</span>.</div>
